WEBVTT

00:14.688 --> 00:19.172
You've only heard the cold, cold beat A rhythm

00:19.252 --> 00:26.959
made of steel But this is what we listen to This is

00:27.019 --> 00:28.000
what we feel

00:30.703 --> 00:36.284
It's electric It's alive, you can dance to this

00:36.705 --> 00:41.387
all night It's not the dark, it's not the gray

00:41.768 --> 00:46.511
It's all electric color gray You've only heard

00:46.551 --> 00:53.435
the single note The whisper and the drone But

00:53.535 --> 00:59.879
this is for the stadium You'll never be alone

01:01.435 --> 01:05.978
So raise your hands and shout it out This is the

01:06.038 --> 01:12.322
sound we share We are the sound, we are the crowd

01:12.622 --> 01:15.163
And we are everywhere

01:17.865 --> 01:22.928
This is your 80's education A brand new, better

01:22.948 --> 01:28.511
protocol This is the sound of your salvation A

01:29.192 --> 01:33.614
mixtape here to break your fall It's not the beat

01:33.674 --> 01:39.078
of her machine It's the music in between

01:56.886 --> 02:01.328
My mother's sound was like a thicket cage, a cold

02:01.388 --> 02:08.031
and empty room. But this is like a different age,

02:08.531 --> 02:13.434
a flower in full bloom. I've never heard this

02:13.514 --> 02:20.757
much joy. I've never felt this free. Is this what

02:20.917 --> 02:27.912
I was missing? Is this all for me?

02:28.713 --> 02:33.937
It's all for you The high, the low The sappy songs

02:33.977 --> 02:39.221
that make you cry The harbor in the storm, you

02:39.261 --> 02:44.365
know The soundtrack for your brand new sky

02:52.243 --> 02:57.326
This is your 80's education A brand new, better

02:57.767 --> 03:02.850
protocol This is the sound of your salvation A

03:03.551 --> 03:07.934
mixtape here to break your fall It's not the beat

03:07.994 --> 03:16.499
of a machine It's the music in between

03:37.403 --> 03:41.147
Welcome to the 80s, Jordan. We have a lot to

03:41.207 --> 03:41.507
cover.

